        "jsCode": "// Pick the patient booking key (tolerant to Redis KEYS output shapes).\nconst s = JSON.stringify($input.all());\nconst m = s.match(/remind:[^\"\\\\]+/);\nconst key = m ? m[0] : '';\nreturn [{ json: { key: key } }];",
